        <div id="newJobToast" class="toast hide shadow-lg" role="alert" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" style="border-radius: 15px; overflow: hidden; border: none; min-width: 300px;">
            <div class="toast-header bg-navy text-white p-3">
                <i class="bi bi-bell-fill me-2 animate-ring"></i>
                <strong class="me-auto">ZYCODA SYSTEM</strong>
                <small class="text-white-50">Just now</small>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="toast" aria-label="Close"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="toast-body p-3 bg-white">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center">
                    <div class="flex-shrink-0">
                        <div class="bg-soft-warning p-2 rounded-circle">
                            <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill fs-4"></i>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="ms-3">
                        <h6 class="mb-1 fw-bold text-navy">มีรายการแจ้งซ่อมใหม่!</h6>
                        <p class="mb-0 small text-muted">ระบบอัปเดตข้อมูลให้คุณเรียบร้อยแล้ว</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
